  "suites": {
    "natural": "How a stressed operator in an AR headset actually talks during a wargame: situational lead-ins (적이 보이네, 배터리가 위험해, 앞이 안 보여 ...), ellipsis, politeness shifts (해라 / 주세요 / 주시겠어요 / 주십시오), Korean number words (세 번, 이호기, 칠 번, 넷, 다섯, 셋, 둘), non-Alpha callsigns, drone commands with and without a team. Every non-default tool at least once.",
    "adversarial": "Near-misses and traps. DefaultResponse: unsupported look-alikes (zoom, speed, altitude, formation, attack target, map scale), two actions in one sentence, negated commands, missing required number or team, invalid callsigns, state questions, deprecated distance move. Genuine but tricky: camera vs view, team view vs overview vs team camera, team vs drone return, recommendation cancel vs window close vs confirm accept/reject (편집 취소 확인, 게임 종료 취소), marker move vs create vs marker filter, filter vs filter window vs video-through, the four control verbs, team type+count vs entry screen, team vs drone tactics edit."
